     A* ARINVPLF - creates object ARINVP: old invoice file name, now a
     A* DDS logical file over SQL table AR_INVOICES (system name ARINV).
     A* An SQL index puts its key columns first in the record format, so
     A* for ARINVP (key ININV = 2nd field) the level identifier would
     A* change; a DDS LF keeps the old field order -> same level id.
     A* CRTLF FILE(DODIKIBMI2/ARINVP) SRCMBR(ARINVPLF)
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R ARINVR                    PFILE(ARINV)
     A            INCUST
     A            ININV
     A            INIDAT
     A            INDUE
     A            INAMT
     A            INPAID
     A            INLPDT
     A            INSTS
     A          K ININV
